      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was renamed Morea in 1893 when the Dawson Coal Company ran the colliery before it was bought by Madeira and Hill Corporation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
